<h1>Frances Ann Hurley</h1>
<p>Illinois Senate, 18th District, on the Chicago ballot November 3, 2026. Party: Democratic.</p>
<p><a href="https://franhurley.com/" rel="nofollow noopener">Campaign site (franhurley.com)</a></p>
<h2>Running on</h2>
<p>Her campaign lists three priorities: seniors (property tax relief, lower prescription drug costs), first responders (access to mental health services and suicide prevention resources), and affordability (rising costs of groceries, utilities and housing).</p>
<h2>Background</h2>
<p>State representative for the 35th District from 2013 to 2023, then a member of the Illinois Labor Relations Board; earlier an aide to 19th Ward aldermen and a project manager at the Cook County Sheriff&#39;s Office.</p>
